This licence covers only the work added to this repository by the FaMAF CVA6
Project:

  - gem5_config_CVA6/      the gem5 configuration matched to CVA6, its
                           calibration harnesses, the MinorCPU patch and the
                           benchmark programs on both sides
  - scripts/               the repository's own sweeps, checks, formatters and
                           container tools
  - dockerfiles/           the Docker files used to build the images
  - viewers/FlowCompare.html   the side-by-side comparison viewer, which
                           exists only in this repository
  - README.md and the other documentation written for this fork

  - verilator_changes/     the DDR3 memory model in ddr3_memory/, its RTL
                           and its standalone testbench, and PARTLY the two
                           diffs, vcd_window/vcd_window.patch and
                           ddr3_memory/ddr3_memory.patch: the changes are this
                           project's, and the files they change belong to the
                           OpenHW Group and ETH Zurich:
                           corev_apu/tb/ariane_tb.cpp,
                           corev_apu/tb/ariane_testharness.sv and the Makefile
                           at the root. Those stay under their original Apache
                           2.0 and Solderpad 0.51 terms, and once
                           scripts/patch_cva6_testbench.py applies a diff each
                           carries a notice saying what was changed, as those
                           licences require.

It does not cover the CVA6 core or its dependencies, which are the work of the
OpenHW Group and contributors and stay under their original licences: see
LICENSE, LICENSE.Berkeley and LICENSE.SiFive, all preserved here.

The two viewers under viewers/CVA6Flow and viewers/MinorFlow are git
submodules. They are not part of this repository's tree and carry this same MIT
licence in their own repositories. viewers/FlowCompare.html is not a submodule:
it is a tracked file of this repository and is covered above.

